<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Sterett in the Gulf of Thailand, 1977</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that tensions&amp;nbsp;between Vietnam and Thailand increased during the mid-1970s.&amp;nbsp; Vietnam has threatened to attack shipping&amp;nbsp;en route to and from Thai ports.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The CIA is concerned that Vietnam may attack&amp;nbsp;American-flagged merchant vessels.&amp;nbsp; Being able to strike a blow against both America and Thailand&amp;nbsp;would have a great deal of symbolic, if not practical,&amp;nbsp;value to the Vietnamese government.&amp;nbsp; And Vietnam believes America, especially an America led by Jimmy Carter, lacks the will to make any significant response to such acts.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;An&amp;nbsp;American task force based around the cruiser &lt;EM&gt;Sterett&lt;/EM&gt; has been dispatched to the Gulf of Thailand to keep an eye on things.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
